Saya Couple — optional AMD/ROCm VRAM safety patch for ComfyUI core (comfy/model_management.py).
Base: ComfyUI upstream 41db8f4f. Only active on AMD GPUs under ROCm; no effect on NVIDIA/CPU.
- hard VRAM cap = VRAM free at startup - 1 GiB for the desktop (set_per_process_memory_fraction)
- get_free_memory clamped to the cap
- full unload instead of partial unload
- no re-promotion of an already partially loaded model
Apply with apply_amd_vram_patch.py (git apply). Revert with --revert.

diff --git a/comfy/model_management.py b/comfy/model_management.py
